{
  "slug": "todo4",
  "name": "Todo4",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Todo4 gives Claude Code a durable memory for your work. Ask Claude to create tasks, log follow-ups mid-debugging, or break an epic into subtasks — and those tasks persist across sessions, projects, and even other agents (Claude Cowork, OpenClaw).\n\nThere are 16 MCP tools cover the full lifecycle (create, update, close, comment, subtasks, tags, notifications) plus a /todo4:status command for a quick overdue / due-today dashboard. Free tier available, OAuth sign-in handles auth on first use.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `connect` (Check the Todo4 MCP connection status and walk the user through authentication if needed), `status` (Show the user's current Todo4 task status — overdue, due today, and top open tasks by priority)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `todo4`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install todo4@claude-community` from `panitw/todo4-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
